--- !u!114 &3137301226388747338
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6072791394911611373}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 61ce81e1ec2540d48a151a1255dcfbe9, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  jokes:
  - GunLike 2 releases Febuary 2024.
  - Did you know GunLike Classic was made from Scratch?
  - A man walked into a room full of computer geeks, The man said "wow, a lot of
    zeros and ones"  One of the geeks replied "you mean, binary?"  The man replied
    "no, you're all ugly."
  - A man walks into a bar. "Ouch!"
  - When my chemist friend spilled their coffee, they asked me if that coffee had
    any creamer in it and immedietly ran to the lab to analyze it. When they saw
    the results, they started to cry.
  - Yesterday I saw someone reading a magazine in the rain. I warned them "Be carefull,
    when they are wet they can jam"
  - There are 2 kinds of people in this world. Those who can extrapolate data from
    unfinished sets,
  - A programmer walks into a bar. They order 1 drink, they order 5 drinks, they
    order -1 drinks, they order 1000 drinks. A bugtester walks into the bar, they
    ask where the bathroom is. The bar goes up in flames.
  - A programming student's first assignment is to make the computer say "Hello World".
    After pulling their hair out from stress, they ask for an extension. Their teacher
    asks "Why are you having so much trouble with this?", the student responds "How
    do you expect us to get these computers to do anything? the mouse doesn't work,
    the keyboard doesn't work, the screen is always black!" The teacher then turns
    the computer on.
  - '"My dog has no nose", "How does he smell?", "Awfull!"'
  - I farted in my wallet, now I have gas money.
  - There are 10 kinds of people in the world. Those who understand binary, and those
    who don't.
  - Why did the chicken cross the road? To get to the other side!
  - Why did the leaf turn red when someone pretty walked by? Because the leaf was
    fall-ing for them!
  - IP Address? You mean the bathroom???
  - 127.0.0.1, Look familiar?
  - What goes ooooooooooooooooo!!?, A cow with no lips.
  - how does jack frost get to work? by-icicle!
  - this spider won't let me slide!!!... oh nevermind... it's just under control...
  - i named my noisy horse after a condiment... after all, Mayo Neighs!
  - "Knock, knock. Who\u2019s there? Interrupting cow. Interrupting c- MOO!"
  - What do you call a fish with no eyes? A fsh!
  - What do you call a fish with no eyes? A blind fish!
  - Are you going to a British bathroom right now?... 'cause you're the only ten-i-see!
  - Are you going to a British bathroom right now?... 'cause you're the only ten-i-see!
  - Are you from Nashville? Cuz you're-a-peein'!
  - What do you call a fish with no eyes? Call a vet- oh my goodness..! Why do you
    still have the game open?!
  - '"I see!" says the blind man to the deaf man peeing in the wind. "It''s all coming
    back to me"'
  - 'There are three types of Gun-Like-2 players: those who can count correctly and
    those who cannot.'
  - "What\u2019s the difference between a rabbit and a plum? They\u2019re both purple!...Except
    for the rabbit."
  - How do you kill a blue Elephant?  With a blue elephant gun obviously.
  - How do you kill a red elephant? You choke it until it turns blue then use the
    blue elephant gun from earlier.
  - How do you kill a green elephant? You tickle it until it turns red then choke
    it until it turns blue, then use a blue elephant gun from earlier.
  - How do you kill a purple elephant? There's no such thing as a purple elephant...idiot.
  - "Why can\u2019t a nose be 12 inches long? Because then it\u2019d be a foot!"
  - Two guys walk into a bar... The third one ducks!
  - A dyslexic man walks into a bra. (the age rating for this game was raised for
    this joke alone)
  - What do you call a fly with no wings? A walk!
  - What did the mime say to his audience? Nothing....? it's a mime dude.....
  - How do you organize a party in space? You planet!
  - 'What did one lawyer say to the other lawyer?  "We are both lawyers." '
  - What's white, can't climb a tree, could be running right now and MIGHT have elephants
    in it? Your refrigerator. (you should go check)
  - What's white, can't climb a tree, could be running right now and MIGHT have elephants
    in it? Your refrigerator. (you should go check)
  txt: {fileID: 2040637735232960711}
